      "message": "T36: exploratory resplits on re-run Kaggle checks (200 resplits of the 52 expert-labelled patients)\n\nThe cluster runs kept only totals, so the calibration and test per-rule checks were re-run on\nKaggle at the frozen commit. Kaggle did not reproduce the cluster numbers exactly (lambda-hat\n0.562 vs 0.766); the resplit analysis uses the Kaggle checks only. The primary split's test rate\nis in the worst 2% of the resplits.",
